WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:00.516
Hi.

00:00:00.516 --> 00:00:01.667
I'm Soya, a cat.

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:07.713
And this is Soycatory: a small factory that makes friendly apps for everyday people.

00:00:08.363 --> 00:00:09.777
The idea is simple.

00:00:09.777 --> 00:00:13.128
One small app a day, until something catches.

00:00:13.778 --> 00:00:17.623
Every app speaks plain words, in English and Hebrew.

00:00:17.623 --> 00:00:18.141
No ads.

00:00:18.141 --> 00:00:19.028
No tracking.

00:00:19.028 --> 00:00:21.098
It just works on your phone.

00:00:21.748 --> 00:00:25.750
There are apps for small cats, like Soya News and Animal Facts.

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:29.497
And apps for big cats, like Read It Simply and Kafka Check.

00:00:30.147 --> 00:00:31.457
And you are part of it.

00:00:31.457 --> 00:00:35.215
Try an app, tell us what you would add, and the factory builds it.

00:00:35.865 --> 00:00:37.491
AI helps build the apps.

00:00:37.491 --> 00:00:41.826
But people review every one, and every fact links to its source.

00:00:42.476 --> 00:00:43.928
So come and try them.

00:00:43.928 --> 00:00:46.072
And tell me what you would add.

00:00:46.072 --> 00:00:46.417
Meow.

